    "detailed_description": "In &quot;Red Hood's Hunt for the Wolf,&quot; players take on the role of Red Riding Hood as she embarks on a dangerous journey through forests and caves to find and defeat the evil wolf. Along the way, Red will face various enemies, such as skeletons, elves, and other creatures, wielding her small sword to fight them off. The gameplay is a classic platformer where players must overcome obstacles, collect coins, and battle foes to reach the ultimate goal\u2014defeating the wolf and saving the forest from his wicked plans.<br><br>Features:<br><br><strong>Platformer Action:</strong> Jump through levels and overcome obstacles.<br><strong>Enemy Variety:</strong> Battle skeletons, elves, and more.<br><strong>Sword Combat:</strong> Fight enemies with Red Hood\u2019s sword.<br><strong>Boss Battle: </strong>Defeat the wolf to save the forest.<br><strong>Collect Coins:</strong> Unlock rewards along the way.",
